{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2953","id":3087797879,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz8864DA53","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2953","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2953.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2953.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2953","number":2953,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: list-routes command now respects identifier filter with JSON output","user":{"login":"roganlynch","id":44678921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0Njc4OTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44678921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch","html_url":"https://github.com/roganlynch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/roganlynch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #2927\n\n## Problem\nIn v0.27.0, the `list-routes` command with `-i` flag and `-o json` output was returning all nodes instead of just the specified node.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe JSON output was happening **before** the identifier filtering logic in the `listNodeRoutesCmd` function. When `-i 12 -o json` was specified, the function would output all nodes from `response.GetNodes()` and continue execution, never using the filtered `nodes` variable for JSON output.\n\n## Solution\nMoved the JSON output block from before the filtering logic to after it, ensuring it outputs the `nodes` variable (which has been filtered by both identifier and route existence) instead of the unfiltered `response.GetNodes()`.\n\n## Changes\n- Moved lines 231-233 (JSON output) to after line 245 (after filtering)\n- Changed output from `response.GetNodes()` to `nodes` (filtered variable)\n- Added early return after JSON output to prevent table rendering\n\n## Testing\nThis restores the v0.26.1 behavior where:\n```bash\nheadscale nodes list-routes -i 12 -o json\n```\ncorrectly returns only node 12's route information instead of all nodes.","created_at":"2025-12-10T03:23:26Z","updated_at":"2025-12-10T05:19:18Z","closed_at":"2025-12-10T05:19:18Z","merged_at":"2025-12-10T05:19:17Z","merge_commit_sha":"5d0a6ab0e96bc383a8ba1bf7669ca3c4aea0279d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"juanfont","id":181059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MTA1OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/181059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/juanfont","html_url":"https://